some careless kid...

00:16:51.210 --> 00:16:54.280
What a cute kitty! 
Where did it come from?

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.370
You're so cute!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.830
<i>No! No! I have a job to do!</i>

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.770
<i>I have to hand these out to everyone.</i>

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:04.870
<i>There's only one copy per student,</i>

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.880
<i>so I have to keep hold of them.</i>

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:11.650
It's finally over!

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:12.840
Ready to go home?

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:14.340
Not forgetting anything, are you?

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:17.550
If I am, it's okay. I've got Hayate.

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:21.910
Still, who loses handouts just 
walking from the faculty room

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:23.850
