them before I realized it...

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:29.900
But shouldn't you have noticed that?

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:32.500
You really are careless, Izumi.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:36.880
Well, from now on, just try 
not to do anything careless

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:38.280
