I'll take a picture! Snap! Snap!

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.900
Yeah! Trains and Ayasaki 
really are the best!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.280
Oh! There's Ayasaki!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.590
I'll take a picture! Snap! Snap!

